<title>USA: Enviro Recovery names Jack Birnholtz CEO.</title>
<headline>Enviro Recovery names Jack Birnholtz CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ASHLAND, Wis. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enviro Recovery Inc Tuesday named Jack Birnholtz chief executive officer and chairman of the company.</p>
<p>Birnholz, president of Enviro's predecessor Resource Recovery Inc, replaces Harvey Smith, who became the company's vice chairman.</p>
</text>
